WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.220
Effective analysis begins by separating
empirical observations from the values

2
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:08.880
we assign to them. On the left graphic, an
AI scans a painting and identifies

3
00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:12.240
a pixel is yellow. That's an empirical
observation.

4
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.680
It cannot determine beauty without a
programmed normative rule.

5
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.380
Moving to the right floor chart, we see
the human equivalent.

6
00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.160
Observing a student lied about homework is
a factual step.

7
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.980
Concluding this lie is wrong requires
human evaluation, a moral judgment.

8
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:32.700
Conflating raw data with moral judgment
creates a flawed foundation,

9
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:35.760
leading to conclusions that lack logical
integrity.
